# Guide copy sync

Player-facing primer copy lives in `src/i18n/messages/*.json` (`guide.*` keys). `src/content/guideContent.ts` only orders those topics.

## When to update

If you change any of these systems, update **both** the i18n guide keys **and** `GAME_DESIGN.md` § score / evac / survival:

- Day multiplier or extraction scoring
- Evac beacon timing, horde clock, cargo kit rules
- Survival meters, injury model, or death conditions
- Combat stances, flee DC, or noise mechanics described in the guide

## Do not

- Duplicate long rule text in `guideContent.ts` — keep prose in i18n JSON
- Ship gameplay rule changes without checking the in-game guide still matches
